        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 1,
        "text": "Harbor Light Meeting — Q1/Q2 Withholding Review & Quarterly Filing Prep"
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "Prepared by: Sylvia Nakamura, Payroll Specialist — Prepared for: Harbor Light engagement team. This package consolidates the Q1/Q2 withholding review, the quarterly filing checklist, and notes on the Blue Fir tip-allocation amendment that may surface in state correspondence."
      },
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "1. Withholding Review Summary — Q1 & Q2 2025"
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "The withholding review for Harbor Light covers federal Form 941, state withholding returns, and the related payroll tax liability accounts for the first two quarters of 2025. The review confirms that amounts withheld, deposited, and reported agree within tolerance, with the exception of the Blue Fir Q1 Oregon tip-allocation adjustment noted in Section 3."
      },
      {
        "kind": "table",
        "columns": ["Quarter", "Federal 941 Filed", "Oregon Withholding Filed", "Total Wages", "Federal Withholding", "State Withholding", "Status"],
        "rows": [
          ["Q1 2025", "April 30, 2025", "April 30, 2025 (amended May 15, 2025)", "$1,284,550.00", "$218,375.00", "$86,410.00", "Amended — see Section 3"],
          ["Q2 2025", "July 31, 2025 (due)", "$145,200.00", "$24,880.00", "$9,745.00", "Pending filing"]
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "Note: Q2 totals reflect payroll through June 30, 2025, and are preliminary pending final payroll cutoff."
      },
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "2. Quarterly Filing Checklist — Q2 2025"
      },
      {
        "kind": "list",
        "ordered": true,
        "items": [
          "Confirm all payroll runs through June 30, 2025 are posted and reconciled to the general ledger.",
          "Run the payroll tax liability report and compare to deposits made (federal and state).",
          "Prepare and review Form 941 for Q2 — sign-off required from engagement lead.",
          "Prepare Oregon Combined Withholding return (Form OQ) for Q2 — verify against state account balance.",
          "Submit Q2 filings electronically by the due date; retain confirmation receipts in the payroll folder.",
          "Update the Harbor Light withholding review workbook with final Q2 numbers and any adjustments."
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "3. Blue Fir Q1 Amendment — Tip Allocation"
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "Blue Fir's Q1 Oregon withholding return was amended in May 2025 to correct a tip-allocation error. The amended return and the corresponding payment confirmation are filed in the payroll folder under Blue Fir / Q1 Amendment. Any state notice regarding Q1 that arrives at the firm or the client almost certainly crossed in the mail with the amendment."
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "If Harbor Light team members receive a state inquiry about Blue Fir Q1, they should direct the inquiry to the payroll specialist (Sylvia Nakamura) before responding. The amendment resolves the discrepancy; no further client action is expected at this time."
      },
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "4. Timing & Next Steps"
      },
      {
        "kind": "list",
        "ordered": true,
        "items": [
          "13:00 call today: settle FY2025 PBC timing — Sylvia to provide Q1/Q2 withholding details on that call.",
          "Complete Q2 filings by July 31, 2025.",
          "Provide updated withholding review workbook to Harbor Light engagement lead after Q2 filing.",
          "Monitor for any Oregon state notices related to Blue Fir Q1 — route to Sylvia."
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
